WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
…uneasy when you wake up, but by the
time you're brushing your teeth, it's

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
already fading. During REM sleep,
that deep stage where your eyes

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.480
dart beneath your eyelids and the
most vivid dreams occur, your brain

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:18.160
performs what scientists call, file
compression, sorting through the day's

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.310
events, discarding what doesn't
matter, and keeping what does.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.440
Had an awkward conversation?

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.810
Your mind might replay it
with slight distortions.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.330
Worried about money?

